<title>USA: Kansas feedlot cattle quiet, no sales - USDA.</title>
<headline>Kansas feedlot cattle quiet, no sales - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DODGE CITY 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade was quiet, with no sales slaughter steers or heifers, USDA said. Inquiry moderate, demand light.</p>
<p>Sales confirmed for the week to date on 1100 cattle, mostly previously contracted or formulated cattle.</p>
<p>Confirmed -   none   week ago -   500   year ago - none</p>
<p>wk to date - 1,100   week ago - 3,300   year ago - 5,600</p>
<p>(Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8720)</p>
